WEBVTT

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:14.390
<i>Kakugane, the paranormal alloy forged</i> <i>from the essence of alchemy...</i>

00:00:15.570 --> 00:00:18.630
<i>Activated by the person's fighting instinct,</i>

00:00:18.910 --> 00:00:21.970
<i>the possessor converts</i> <i>their latent power into form</i>

00:00:22.410 --> 00:00:25.070
<i>and creates a weapon like no other.</i>

00:00:26.210 --> 00:00:29.010
<i>That is Buso Renkin.</i>

00:00:33.950 --> 00:00:36.510
Brobdingnag Knuckles!

00:00:36.590 --> 00:00:38.020
l do have a weapon!

00:00:38.320 --> 00:00:41.020
My thoroughly trained warrior body is my weapon.

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:50.130
l told you... l am not angry!

00:00:56.470 --> 00:01:01.540
I'll do it. lf we leave the LXE as is, this town will go to pieces.

00:01:02.380 --> 00:01:05.650
Captain Bravo, please make me an alchemist warrior!

00:01:06.220 --> 00:01:09.310
Kazuki Muto, you won't be able to win by

00:01:09.390 --> 00:01:12.260
only relying upon the power of the Buso Renkin.

00:01:12.490 --> 00:01:17.160
You will certainly lose and die after your next fight.

00:01:19.060 --> 00:01:21.430
First, in order to make you into an alchemist warrior,

00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:23.020
I'll train you without mercy.

00:01:23.470 --> 00:01:26.930
lf you don't want to die, sink your teeth in with a do-or-die resolve! Got it?!

00:01:31.210 --> 00:01:33.240
And you too, warrior Tokiko.

00:01:34.650 --> 00:01:37.280
Protecting rookies is my duty.

00:01:38.280 --> 00:01:40.280
Leave Muto to me.

00:01:40.650 --> 00:01:43.780
You must once again re-awaken the warrior you are.

00:01:44.120 --> 00:01:46.850
lf you don't... you'll also be defeated and die.

00:01:48.790 --> 00:01:52.590
<i>A Night in the Dorm</i>

00:01:53.160 --> 00:01:56.160
—What was that just now?
—Wasn't it an earthquake?

00:01:56.470 --> 00:01:58.560
l kind of saw something strange on the roof for an instant.

00:01:58.640 --> 00:02:00.610
l saw it, l saw it, l saw it, too!

00:02:01.070 --> 00:02:01.940
Shall we go check it out?

00:02:02.640 --> 00:02:04.870
Whoa, it's starting to turn into an uproar.

00:02:05.180 --> 00:02:06.870
No point in wearing out our welcome.
Let's go.

00:02:07.280 --> 00:02:08.300
Yahoo...

00:02:09.850 --> 00:02:10.910
He's still...!

00:02:11.180 --> 00:02:12.620
l missed his vital spots.

00:02:13.050 --> 00:02:16.650
We need to have him tell us the particulars about the LXE.

00:02:17.160 --> 00:02:19.720
Not a chance. lf l were to do something like that,

00:02:19.790 --> 00:02:23.090
who knows what Doctor Butterfly would do to me?

00:02:23.260 --> 00:02:24.290
Don't worry about it.

00:02:24.460 --> 00:02:28.190
You'll end up wanting to talk regardless of your will.

00:02:29.670 --> 00:02:31.140
l don't know about that.

00:02:37.440 --> 00:02:41.710
<i>Good work, Kinjo.</i>
<i>I'll let you die comfortably.</i>

00:02:41.910 --> 00:02:44.210
Thanks... Jinnai.

00:02:48.550 --> 00:02:49.990
He killed his comrade.

00:02:50.420 --> 00:02:51.720
He silenced him.

00:02:52.020 --> 00:02:54.620
<i>I'll leave you with the kakugane</i> <i>for the moment,</i>

00:02:54.690 --> 00:02:56.680
<i>but I'll have you return it to me soon.</i>

00:02:56.890 --> 00:02:59.490
<i>Recovering that is my duty.</i>

00:03:00.400 --> 00:03:02.960
<i>We can replace all</i> <i>the homunculi we want,</i>

00:03:03.030 --> 00:03:06.370
<i>but unfortunately there is a limit</i> <i>to the number of kakugane.</i>

00:03:06.740 --> 00:03:07.800
<i>See you later, then.</i>

00:03:24.120 --> 00:03:26.320
This isn't my day.

00:03:26.590 --> 00:03:29.060
Why should we have to carry stuff like this?

00:03:29.460 --> 00:03:31.360
Yeah-yeah. Just don't spill it.

00:03:38.140 --> 00:03:39.630
That guy just now...

00:03:40.200 --> 00:03:41.500
The drama club?

00:03:41.840 --> 00:03:42.830
Wrong.

00:03:43.510 --> 00:03:46.310
Well, for your own sakes, you'd better not get involved.

00:03:49.950 --> 00:03:51.110
Kakugane...

00:03:51.550 --> 00:03:53.980
So he gives even small fries like that kakugane

00:03:54.120 --> 00:03:55.640
and l don't get any?

00:03:56.850 --> 00:03:59.150
This is most unpleasant.

00:04:00.360 --> 00:04:02.420
There are three clear facts.

00:04:03.190 --> 00:04:07.290
The first is Papillon.
He still doesn't possess a kakugane.

00:04:08.170 --> 00:04:10.140
lt seems his man-eating has come under control.

00:04:10.700 --> 00:04:13.400
There'd probably be no problem with putting him on the back burner.

00:04:14.370 --> 00:04:15.930
The second is the LXE.

00:04:16.540 --> 00:04:18.600
From the developments earlier,

00:04:18.680 --> 00:04:20.870
it seems they have no intention of launching

00:04:20.950 --> 00:04:23.350
an all-out attack at the moment.

00:04:23.610 --> 00:04:28.080
l concluded that the strongest LXE warrior, the traitor,

00:04:28.150 --> 00:04:30.490
is still not in the best of condition yet.

00:04:31.220 --> 00:04:34.950
Of course...there is no reason for us to wait for their attack.

00:04:35.360 --> 00:04:37.290
We must quickly locate their hideout,

00:04:37.360 --> 00:04:41.230
assess their strength and numbers, and destroy them in one blow!

00:04:41.930 --> 00:04:43.870
And third is Muto...

00:04:44.370 --> 00:04:45.340
You.

00:04:46.000 --> 00:04:51.170
l see. Your Sunlight Heart is powerful, just as warrior Tokiko reported.

00:04:51.740 --> 00:04:54.370
However, it's pretty much certain that you can't beat...

00:04:54.450 --> 00:04:56.940
a humanoid homunculus now.

00:04:57.320 --> 00:04:58.340
Training...

00:04:58.880 --> 00:05:01.250
Special training. You'll start today.

00:05:03.450 --> 00:05:04.050
Right.

00:05:04.890 --> 00:05:08.220
Warrior Chief. I'll also help out with Kazuki's special training.

00:05:08.590 --> 00:05:12.090
No, l want to call upon you for a different mission.

00:05:16.830 --> 00:05:19.240
<i>Cafeteria</i>

00:05:26.140 --> 00:05:26.910
—Seconds, please.
—Seconds, please.

00:05:31.720 --> 00:05:33.010
—Thanks for the meal!
—Thanks for the meal!

00:05:33.220 --> 00:05:34.080
l won!

00:05:34.190 --> 00:05:35.350
Not bad. lt's a draw.

00:05:36.520 --> 00:05:39.650
All right, let's go, Muto!
Are you prepared?!

00:05:40.190 --> 00:05:42.220
Yeah, Bravo. Very much so!

00:05:42.560 --> 00:05:45.290
As a matter of fact, l'm a master of special training!

00:05:45.360 --> 00:05:46.460
<i>Trainee</i>

00:05:47.030 --> 00:05:49.930
Bravo! But l'm also a master of special training!

00:05:50.000 --> 00:05:50.990
<i>Trainer</i>

00:05:51.300 --> 00:05:53.290
So, what special training?

00:05:53.470 --> 00:05:55.410
lt's a secret. Because...

00:05:55.840 --> 00:05:57.640
—it's cooler that way!
—lt's cooler that way!

00:06:09.850 --> 00:06:11.480
Big Brother and Captain Bravo left.

00:06:11.960 --> 00:06:12.620
Huh?

00:06:13.060 --> 00:06:14.320
You're not going with them?

00:06:14.890 --> 00:06:15.760
Nope...

00:06:16.030 --> 00:06:18.260
Really? That's a first.

00:06:19.130 --> 00:06:20.330
Sometimes it happens...

00:06:20.500 --> 00:06:23.400
Then let's just us girls hang out.

00:06:23.800 --> 00:06:26.790
N-No thanks!
Stuff like that's not my thing.

00:06:27.070 --> 00:06:29.400
Then how about if a guy was with you, too?

00:06:29.640 --> 00:06:30.400
That's not what l meant!

00:06:30.470 --> 00:06:32.880
What're we going to play?
Othello!

00:06:33.680 --> 00:06:35.650
Only two can play!

00:06:37.210 --> 00:06:38.270
What about you, Chii-chan?

00:06:38.820 --> 00:06:42.250
Hmm...l guess, Memory.

00:06:42.590 --> 00:06:45.580
—Here we go! Chii-chan's love of Memory.
—Here we go! Chii-chan's love of Memory.

00:06:46.920 --> 00:06:48.520
You have something, Tokiko?

00:06:48.890 --> 00:06:50.890
No, really, I'll pass.

00:06:51.230 --> 00:06:52.820
What? Really?

00:06:53.460 --> 00:06:55.490
Sorry... Some other time.

00:06:56.000 --> 00:06:59.230
Hmm, l guess it can't be helped.
Some other time.

00:06:59.870 --> 00:07:00.600
lt's a promise.

00:07:01.940 --> 00:07:05.600
Sorry... huh? Why did l apologize?

00:07:14.220 --> 00:07:15.550
There, huh?

00:07:20.790 --> 00:07:23.060
<i>l want to call upon you for</i> <i>a different mission.</i>

00:07:23.930 --> 00:07:27.730
<i>ln a battle between an alchemist warrior</i> <i>and a humanoid homunculus,</i>

00:07:27.800 --> 00:07:30.100
<i>kakugane is exactly like</i> <i>a chess piece.</i>

00:07:30.670 --> 00:07:33.000
<i>lf you take the piece,</i> <i>it becomes battle strength for your army.</i>

00:07:33.070 --> 00:07:35.300
<i>lf the piece is taken, it becomes</i> <i>the opponent's battle strength.</i>

00:07:38.910 --> 00:07:41.340
<i>l want you to protect this.</i>

00:07:41.750 --> 00:07:44.270
<i>We want to focus on special training,</i> <i>you see?</i>

00:07:44.650 --> 00:07:49.110
<i>Then, I'll take charge of this and</i> <i>help with the special training as well.</i>

00:07:50.960 --> 00:07:54.620
<i>l told you. Leave the protection</i> <i>of the rookie to me.</i>

00:07:55.190 --> 00:07:58.060
<i>You're too nice to Kazuki Muto.</i>

00:07:59.300 --> 00:08:04.290
<i>True, l did give priority to protecting Kazuki</i> <i>above all else during the Papillon thing,</i>

00:08:05.040 --> 00:08:07.060
<i>even with a homunculus</i> <i>right in front of me...</i>

00:08:07.810 --> 00:08:10.640
<i>You must once again re-awaken</i> <i>the warrior you are.</i>

00:08:11.310 --> 00:08:14.110
<i>lf you don't, you'll be defeated</i> <i>and die as well.</i>

00:08:15.080 --> 00:08:17.450
<i>The warrior l am...</i>

00:08:20.690 --> 00:08:21.780
What's this?!

00:08:22.820 --> 00:08:24.190
Buso Renkin.

00:08:24.420 --> 00:08:26.120
Noisy Hamelin!

00:08:38.270 --> 00:08:40.000
<i>Ultrasonic waves? Oscillating waves?</i>

00:08:40.470 --> 00:08:42.530
<i>Whatever it is, it's extraordinary.</i>

00:08:43.070 --> 00:08:44.040
<i>lt's an enemy attack!</i>

00:08:47.210 --> 00:08:51.110
Now then, start looking for the important treasure...

00:08:51.450 --> 00:08:53.880
my adorable beasts.

00:09:06.100 --> 00:09:06.960
Must've been my imagination

00:09:08.930 --> 00:09:09.990
Darn it!

00:09:10.070 --> 00:09:10.930
lt's a transmitter.

00:09:11.640 --> 00:09:15.160
Have l been detected?
But, it's too late now.

00:09:17.410 --> 00:09:20.170
lf things have made it this far,
I'll figure everything out with sound.

00:09:20.680 --> 00:09:23.580
Now for my adorable beasts to...

00:09:29.420 --> 00:09:31.980
Kakugane...

00:09:32.660 --> 00:09:33.820
Kakugane...

00:09:33.890 --> 00:09:35.420
What will you do now?

00:09:35.890 --> 00:09:39.920
All those who have their brains instilled with the tones of the Noisy Hamelin

00:09:40.000 --> 00:09:42.690
are my allies and your enemies.

00:09:44.640 --> 00:09:49.630
—Kakugane...Kakugane...
—Kakugane...Kakugane...

00:09:52.080 --> 00:09:55.210
<i>Hypnotic control! The effects of</i> <i>the sound waves from before!</i>

00:09:55.480 --> 00:09:56.340
<i>Then...!</i>

00:09:57.720 --> 00:09:58.910
<i>The enemy is not that far!</i>

00:09:58.980 --> 00:10:00.750
<i>He's definitely within the range</i> <i>of the audible sound...</i>

00:10:00.820 --> 00:10:02.180
<i>in the audible direction!</i>

00:10:03.750 --> 00:10:04.480
Tokiko.

00:10:05.790 --> 00:10:06.690
Kazuki?!

00:10:06.820 --> 00:10:08.450
What's up. l'm Kazuki.

00:10:11.460 --> 00:10:14.760
Sorry. Please have a little patience, Tokiko.

00:10:15.270 --> 00:10:20.400
Right. l'm a pervert anyway, so.

00:10:23.840 --> 00:10:24.600
Let go of me...

00:10:24.680 --> 00:10:25.510
Huh?!

00:10:26.610 --> 00:10:27.870
Don't touch me!

00:10:28.450 --> 00:10:29.610
I'll touch you!

00:10:30.680 --> 00:10:33.580
Tokiko, you're so smooth to the touch.

00:10:35.720 --> 00:10:41.020
Say, where's the kakugane?
Give me the kakugane!

00:10:41.560 --> 00:10:47.800
—Kakugane...Kakugane...
—Kakugane...Kakugane...

00:10:52.140 --> 00:10:53.160
Bravo...

00:10:53.240 --> 00:10:55.100
Back Breaker!

00:10:56.270 --> 00:10:58.740
Bravo Octopus Hold!

00:10:59.880 --> 00:11:01.850
Bravo Rotation Throw!

00:11:04.450 --> 00:11:06.440
All right! That's it for the warm-up!

00:11:07.590 --> 00:11:10.020
A Rotation Throw is a warm-up?

00:11:10.450 --> 00:11:14.480
Bravo! We'll start the special training after a ten-minute break!

00:11:20.430 --> 00:11:21.920
Can l ask you one thing?

00:11:22.970 --> 00:11:26.370
We still don't know how organized the LXE is, right?

00:11:27.070 --> 00:11:30.130
lf they're opponents the three of us can't fight against...

00:11:30.770 --> 00:11:32.300
lf so, what will you do?

00:11:34.510 --> 00:11:37.000
Get the police to help or something.

00:11:38.120 --> 00:11:41.520
l see. Then how will you explain it to the police?

00:11:45.490 --> 00:11:49.260
—Kakugane...Kakugane...
—Kakugane...Kakugane...

00:11:51.030 --> 00:11:52.460
Under these circumstances...

00:11:55.070 --> 00:11:56.260
That's right.

00:11:56.700 --> 00:12:00.540
The opposition is just ordinary humans.
There's nothing you can do.

00:12:01.810 --> 00:12:02.700
<i>What should l do?</i>

00:12:03.210 --> 00:12:06.510
Kakugane...
Where's the kakugane...?

00:12:15.590 --> 00:12:17.380
<i>Just you wait, homunculus.</i>

00:12:18.520 --> 00:12:21.460
l may have asked something stupid just then...

00:12:23.030 --> 00:12:24.890
lt's normal to think like that.

00:12:25.500 --> 00:12:30.030
But you've now set foot in an extraordinary world.

00:12:30.900 --> 00:12:32.160
Extraordinary...

00:12:32.800 --> 00:12:35.970
The only ones who can stop an uncommon enemy are us

00:12:36.170 --> 00:12:40.340
who live in a world exceeding reality in the same way.

00:12:41.550 --> 00:12:46.180
No matter how strong the enemy may be, we must defeat them.

00:12:46.780 --> 00:12:47.910
Because...

00:12:49.420 --> 00:12:51.290
we're alchemist warriors.

00:12:55.830 --> 00:12:59.350
<i>The alchemist warrior...is approaching!</i>

00:13:00.100 --> 00:13:05.260
<i>But how? How did she make it through...</i> <i>the siege of beasts?</i>

00:13:06.640 --> 00:13:08.200
<i>Could it be she slashed</i> <i>through all of them?!</i>

00:13:10.870 --> 00:13:12.640
<i>Using the Buso Renkin as her legs!</i>

00:13:13.080 --> 00:13:14.670
l found you, homunculus!

00:13:15.810 --> 00:13:17.340
I'll retreat for the time being!

00:13:17.820 --> 00:13:18.780
l won't let you get away!

00:13:21.820 --> 00:13:22.620
Chii-chan?!

00:13:22.990 --> 00:13:25.420
I'll go to the bathroom and then be getting to bed.

00:13:25.490 --> 00:13:26.150
Look out!

00:13:26.920 --> 00:13:28.520
She looks tasty!

00:13:28.930 --> 00:13:32.890
I'll chomp down on her, heal my wounds and counterattack!

00:13:56.050 --> 00:13:58.920
l understand... the Warrior Chief's intentions!

00:14:00.860 --> 00:14:02.330
Does the wound hurt?

00:14:03.430 --> 00:14:08.160
l wasn't able to have a meal, but it seems we're even.

00:14:08.400 --> 00:14:12.230
My wound is starting to heal.

00:14:12.300 --> 00:14:15.270
The more time passes, the more l have the advantage.

00:14:16.470 --> 00:14:19.100
I'll partake of you after putting some time and labor

00:14:19.180 --> 00:14:22.770
into tearing your entire body apart and making you easier to eat!

00:14:23.410 --> 00:14:27.220
<i>l'm here so that day</i> <i>will not be repeated again.</i>

00:14:27.920 --> 00:14:30.050
<i>And to kill all homunculi!</i>

00:14:37.190 --> 00:14:38.920
l should probably tell you.

00:14:39.400 --> 00:14:40.020
What?

00:14:40.630 --> 00:14:42.030
There's not much difference

00:14:42.100 --> 00:14:45.070
between the food preferences of homunculi and humans.

00:14:45.640 --> 00:14:49.400
Younger and fresher-looking is tastier and stuff like that.

00:14:50.210 --> 00:14:54.140
So when they form a group and take action...

00:14:54.780 --> 00:14:57.680
schools are targeted as a location for securing food.

00:14:59.420 --> 00:15:02.680
Ginsei Academy is the perfect prey in this town.

00:15:03.050 --> 00:15:05.110
And it includes the late-night snack called a dorm.

00:15:06.260 --> 00:15:09.160
Enrolling Tokiko in the school was a preemptive move?

00:15:09.690 --> 00:15:11.420
Rather, a last-ditch effort.

00:15:12.560 --> 00:15:16.730
Seven years ago, we alchemist warriors were a day late and a dollar short,

00:15:17.270 --> 00:15:20.330
and ended up sacrificing an elementary school.

00:15:21.040 --> 00:15:24.070
We must not repeat that tragedy ever again.

00:15:25.040 --> 00:15:26.410
Not just the school.

00:15:28.010 --> 00:15:30.110
Not just my little sister and my friends.

00:15:30.280 --> 00:15:32.880
I'll protect all people from the homunculi!

00:15:34.180 --> 00:15:37.950
For that purpose, you must first get stronger.

00:15:39.690 --> 00:15:42.420
I'll show no mercy!
Prepare yourself!

00:15:43.130 --> 00:15:45.460
l know! Bring it, Bravo!

00:15:45.730 --> 00:15:47.030
—Buso Renkin!
—Buso Renkin!

00:15:47.760 --> 00:15:50.100
Oww!

00:15:50.230 --> 00:15:51.600
Don't make me laugh.

00:15:51.940 --> 00:15:54.300
No way should a monster feel something like pain.

00:15:55.040 --> 00:15:57.840
lt's true. lt really hurts...

00:15:58.040 --> 00:16:01.140
lf you tell me where the LXE base is and who the members are...

00:16:01.250 --> 00:16:03.650
I'll talk! I'll talk, so stop already!

00:16:12.860 --> 00:16:16.820
You've really gone and done it now, little girl!

00:16:16.890 --> 00:16:20.060
I'll make things easier for you if you talk. lf you don't...

00:16:35.680 --> 00:16:39.310
"lf you don't talk,
I'll kill you in hellish pain."

00:16:39.880 --> 00:16:45.980
l can't tell who's the human and who's the monster with that kind of a line.

00:16:46.390 --> 00:16:47.520
Papillon!

00:16:48.160 --> 00:16:54.720
No-no. lt's Pa-pil-lon.
Put more love into it.

00:16:59.500 --> 00:17:00.940
l feel sorry for Kazuki...

00:17:01.000 --> 00:17:02.940
But I'll kill all homunculi in my path!

00:17:11.620 --> 00:17:12.510
A decoy!

00:17:13.920 --> 00:17:18.120
Please tell Muto.
Now I'll get stronger.

00:17:19.260 --> 00:17:21.350
lf he doesn't get stronger,

00:17:21.660 --> 00:17:24.960
he won't be able to protect you this time.

00:17:26.430 --> 00:17:27.360
Don't press your luck!

00:17:31.440 --> 00:17:33.340
Wake up. You okay?

00:17:39.840 --> 00:17:42.570
l kind of feel really sorry about something.

00:17:42.950 --> 00:17:45.920
l feel like l'm happy, embarrassed,

00:17:46.480 --> 00:17:48.420
or like l was just a step away from something.

00:17:48.490 --> 00:17:51.080
Feels nice and smooth to the touch.

00:17:51.150 --> 00:17:53.150
What's up...l'm Kazuki...

00:17:58.030 --> 00:18:00.860
Besides the greater part of their consciousness being asleep...

00:18:00.930 --> 00:18:02.560
there don't seem to be any after-effects.

00:18:02.930 --> 00:18:05.460
No memory of last night should remain.

00:18:06.040 --> 00:18:08.340
Good job. Bravo.

00:18:08.710 --> 00:18:13.010
But Papillon got the kakugane. l'm sorry.

00:18:13.510 --> 00:18:14.530
Don't apologize.

00:18:15.010 --> 00:18:17.850
lt's my fault for overlooking the transmitter in the first place.

00:18:19.080 --> 00:18:22.110
An ordinary high school student suddenly doing warrior special training.

00:18:22.620 --> 00:18:27.150
lt will be extremely rough on him.
Now, l wonder how long he can keep up.

00:18:27.660 --> 00:18:29.920
l think Kazuki can finish it through.

00:18:31.500 --> 00:18:33.090
—However...
—Hmm?

00:18:33.160 --> 00:18:39.430
l still don't want him moving any closer to a world of battle,

00:18:39.500 --> 00:18:41.940
so l won't let any enemy near him.

00:18:43.170 --> 00:18:45.440
I'll fight his share, too.

00:18:50.410 --> 00:18:53.540
Hmm, l wonder if l incited her too much.

00:18:54.220 --> 00:18:56.120
lt seems things have gotten more dangerous instead...

00:18:59.290 --> 00:19:02.120
Even though l understand it's the price that comes with being a warrior,

00:19:02.260 --> 00:19:06.530
to have a child die is something that must be avoided, whatever the cost.

00:19:20.580 --> 00:19:24.210
<i>Last night ended without incident.</i>
<i>But it was luck.</i>

00:19:24.950 --> 00:19:26.850
<i>lf even one gear got off track...</i>

00:19:30.090 --> 00:19:32.720
<i>l have no intention of seeing</i> <i>that sight ever again.</i>

00:19:33.320 --> 00:19:35.120
<i>I'll kill the homunculi!</i>

00:19:35.930 --> 00:19:37.620
<i>I'll kill all enemies!</i>

00:19:51.810 --> 00:19:53.900
Bring it, Bravo!
Where are you?!

00:19:56.510 --> 00:19:59.640
Morning. You'll be late for homeroom.

00:20:00.250 --> 00:20:02.240
Huh? Oh, uh, thanks.

00:20:02.550 --> 00:20:05.390
Umm... Who is she?

00:20:14.420 --> 00:20:17.650
l never would have imagined the LXE making an attack in such a bold way.

00:20:17.960 --> 00:20:20.190
Two homunculi attack Kazuki.

00:20:20.460 --> 00:20:23.860
Those twin siblings...
Who are they?!

00:20:24.360 --> 00:20:26.530
Next time, "The Hayasaka Twins."

00:20:26.600 --> 00:20:28.500
I'll splatter your guts out!

00:20:33.970 --> 00:20:36.210
<i>Mahiro's Buso Renkin Seminar</i>
Hello! This is Mahiro Muto!

00:20:36.280 --> 00:20:39.840
Here's another round of our smashing presentation of Buso Renkin!

00:20:40.150 --> 00:20:41.610
For our third presentation,

00:20:41.680 --> 00:20:44.850
we have Captain Bravo's Buso Renkin, the Silverskin.

00:20:45.320 --> 00:20:48.050
Captain Bravo, the mysterious guy who appeared all of a sudden

00:20:48.120 --> 00:20:52.650
to become the manager at our school dorm in Ginsei school.

00:20:52.960 --> 00:20:56.420
He is known as the Warrior Chief, a very high-ranking alchemist warrior.

00:20:56.500 --> 00:21:00.660
His real name is a secret because "it's cooler that way!"

00:21:01.000 --> 00:21:03.030
That makes no sense!

00:21:03.340 --> 00:21:05.570
Still, he seems like a reliable old man...

00:21:05.910 --> 00:21:08.070
Er.. l mean young man,

00:21:08.140 --> 00:21:12.270
and together with Tokiko and
Big Brother, fights to protect us.

00:21:12.980 --> 00:21:17.680
And so Captain Bravo's Bravo!
Buso Renkin is the Silverskin!

00:21:18.020 --> 00:21:21.010
That weird uniform he wears is really a metal jacket,

00:21:21.090 --> 00:21:22.780
in other words, a protective suit.

00:21:23.260 --> 00:21:26.320
lt can completely shut out any sort of powerful attacks

00:21:26.390 --> 00:21:28.560
by hardening itself into metal.

00:21:29.060 --> 00:21:32.690
And by the way, not only can it shut out physical attacks,

00:21:32.770 --> 00:21:35.670
but also chemical weapons as well!

00:21:35.940 --> 00:21:38.370
Whoa, that's incredible!
He's like a walking nuclear shelter!

00:21:38.910 --> 00:21:40.840
Hmm... maybe that's a bit off?

00:21:40.910 --> 00:21:43.270
Furthermore, even if it the Silverskin gets damaged a bit,

00:21:43.340 --> 00:21:45.510
it can instantly repair itself back to normal.

00:21:46.150 --> 00:21:48.910
Oooh, that lS impenetrable!

00:21:49.280 --> 00:21:53.280
However, the Silverskin itself has absolutely no offensive power.

00:21:53.550 --> 00:21:54.920
However...!

00:21:54.990 --> 00:21:59.480
Bravo's weapon is his own body itself, which has been trained to the limits!

00:21:59.560 --> 00:22:02.760
He's so strong that he can defeat a Homunculus barehanded!

00:22:03.060 --> 00:22:06.800
With his iron-fists and Silverskin,
Bravo is invincible!

00:22:06.870 --> 00:22:12.070
Bring on whatever enemies they have, 'cause Bravo can take them!

00:22:13.040 --> 00:22:15.740
But please, tell us your real name already!

00:22:15.940 --> 00:22:18.570
Okie dokie, tune in next time!

00:22:23.420 --> 00:22:26.940
Mahiro Illustration by: Taeko Hori

00:22:27.820 --> 00:22:31.990
